  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Film-Festival Programme",
    "overview": "Bullseye feels like a warm printed programme made interactive: condensed film titles, quietly ruled schedules, aligned numerical intervals, and an orange mark that points to the next call. The paper surface supports reading and evidence; original typographic film art gives the programme its cinema character.\n\nThe system combines expressive headlines with restrained controls and plain language. Its bullseye geometry is limited to branding, the title band, original artwork, and small status icons. Honest empty states, practice labels, pending receipts, and disclosed evidence belong to this world as naturally as successful predictions.",
